<title>USA: No labor problems at Southwest U.S. nuclear plants.</title>
<headline>No labor problems at Southwest U.S. nuclear plants.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Despite market rumors, there are no labor-related problems at nuclear plants in the U.S. Southwest, spokesmen for utilities operating the plants said Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;We heard there are rumors of labor problems at plants in the Southwest, but there is nothing going on at Palo Verde,&quot; said Kim Hansen, spokesman for Arizona Public Service Co.</p>
<p>The Phoenix-based utility operates the Palo Verde nuclear generating plant.</p>
</text>
